<title>USA: Federated replaces retiring CEO.</title>
<headline>Federated replaces retiring CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailing giant Federated Department Stores Inc.   Friday appointed a new executive</p>
<p>to replace Allen Questrom, the retiring chairman and chief executive who led the company out of bankruptcy.</p>
<p>Federated, at its annual shareholders meeting, introduced James Zimmerman as Questrom's replacement. Zimmerman, 52, has been president and chief operating officer of the company since 1988.</p>
</text>
